ry against the safety of his devoted crew, including the ship's thoughtful surgeon, his best friend.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9477,\"title\":\"King Arthur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzxTnjc3IyVEjISyu3WyyHM0QI6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the 'Sarmatian hypothesis' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11658,\"title\":\"Tae Guk Gi: The Brotherhood of War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efc2MwDwvQsYsbxLXaXtlmOJ7LZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqaKsofz49zjNhi48sxQIq8U73X.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When two brothers are forced to fight in the Korean War, the elder decides to take the riskiest missions if it will help shield the younger from battle.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22972,\"title\":\"Green Zone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/czFIaeukSxNEccysQeys1PCkuOG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3EE9h3xYxIastf5xVLbezH3eGps.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert. Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":927342,\"title\":\"Amaran\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kcspKUpofalIuPgAndZOMJz0hwg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7cNE2qydew1c8fqnlhWjkE3DHc2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A heroic true story of Major Mukund Varadarajan, an Indian Army officer who displayed extraordinary bravery during a counterterrorism mission in Kashmir’s Shopian district. The film captures his courage in protecting his nation and the devotion of his wife Indhu Rebecaa Varghese.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9952,\"title\":\"Rescue Dawn\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ymPlV2ymUBSctfRzpehFOxFmJiS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q4RamDqx4kXCrUvk49o4FmVBbb.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A US Fighter pilot's epic struggle of survival after being shot down on a mission over Laos during the Vietnam War.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76349,\"title\":\"1911\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k93DWz849jCsHW7rIbeUAIxewpr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/io6lNWxoQB9YEjwhcT4CGDjyqhr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"China's first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9839,\"title\":\"Beyond Borders\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j7Upm2AtGuTzCs2Asq0GyBIMAxX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rp09OsrEIpFdsxQjIyWn821Wp7c.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Jordan, an American living in London in 1984, is married to the son of a wealthy British indus